---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import profile from '../assets/profile.jpg';
import { news } from '../data/news';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="about">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I’m Lejun, an audio ML researcher and sound artist. I’m finishing a master’s in Music, Science, and Technology
        at <a href="https://ccrma.stanford.edu/">CCRMA</a>, Stanford, advised by Marina Bosi and Takako Fujioka. Before
        that I studied computer science in the <a href="https://acm.sjtu.edu.cn/home">ACM Honor Class</a> at Shanghai
        Jiao Tong University and was a research assistant at Music X Lab, <a href="https://mbzuai.ac.ae/">MBZUAI</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        My research covers generative audio and music, audio representation learning and signal processing: from
        symbolic music generation with diffusion models to neural audio tokenizers and deepfake detection. I have
        interned at Qwen Audio (Alibaba), <a href="https://labs.smule.com/about/">Smule Labs</a> and{' '}
        <a href="https://csl.sony.fr/">Sony CSL Paris</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        My dream is to bring people closer to artistic creativity. That pulls in two directions: instilling creativity
        into machine learning models, and provoking human creativity through interactive systems for making and
        improvising music.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside research I play <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guzheng">guzheng</a> and piano, produce and mix
        electronic music, paint, compose puerile poems in Chinese calligraphy,{' '}
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ollie_(skateboarding)">ollie</a> over two skateboards, hold spiritual conversations
        on literature and philosophy, and make a good friend within five minutes.
      </p>
      <p class="meta inline-links">
        <a href="/cv/">CV</a>
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        {site.links.map((link) => <a href={link.url}>{link.label}</a>)}
      </p>
    </div>

    <Image class="portrait" src={profile} alt="Lejun Min looking down at an instrument during a performance" width={420} />
  </div>

  <section class="section" style="margin-top: 3rem">
    <h2>News</h2>
    <ul class="rows">
      {
        news.map((entry) => (
          <li>
            <span class="meta">{entry.date}</span>
            <p class="news" set:html={entry.text} />
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap-reverse;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about .prose {
    flex: 1 1 24rem;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: min(100%, 17rem);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .rows .news {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
